   "question": "<ol class=\"parts\" type=\"i\"><li><ol class=\"parts\" type=\"a\"><li>Explain why <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty}\\cosh x\\,\\mathrm dx\"></span> is an improper integral. <span class=\"marks\">(1)</span></li><li>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\infty}\\cosh x\\,\\mathrm dx\"></span> is divergent. <span class=\"marks\">(3)</span></li></ol></li><li><div class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4\\sinh x=p\\cosh x\\qquad\\text{where }p\\text{ is a real constant}\" data-display=\"true\"></div><p>Given that this equation has real solutions, determine the range of possible values for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\"></span></p><span class=\"marks\">(2)</span></li></ol>",
